  characterName: Samira Yassin
  promptText: The Occupation Forces sealed the community well to enable a luxury
    development. Public protest may lead to detention and disruption, while silence
    leaves children drinking scarce or polluted water.
  leftAnswer: Public action can reclaim collective water rights despite risk.
  rightAnswer: Keeping children safe today preserves family stability and care.
